                "content": "<p>Stand on a sheet of paper, mark the back of your heel and the tip of your longest toe, then measure the gap between the two marks. Measure in the evening, when your feet are at their widest, and use that measurement alongside the sizing information on the product page. If you are still unsure, email us at <a href=\"mailto:hello@foottree.com\">hello@foottree.com</a> and we will help you choose.</p>",
