              "type": "_accordion-row-dynamic",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I clean my shoes?",
                "content": "<p>Wipe them with a soft, slightly damp cloth to remove dirt and dust, then leave them to dry naturally. Keep them out of direct sunlight and away from extreme moisture.</p>",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              }
            },
            "row_2": {
              "type": "_accordion-row-dynamic",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "How do I look after leather styles?",
                "content": "<p>Wipe away dust with a soft cloth and condition the leather occasionally to keep it supple and maintain its finish. Avoid leaving leather shoes in direct sunlight.</p>",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              }
            },
            "row_3": {
              "type": "_accordion-row-dynamic",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can I put my shoes in the washing machine?",
                "content": "<p>We would not recommend it. Machine washing and tumble drying can damage the materials and flatten the memory-foam insoles, so cleaning by hand is the safer choice.</p>",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              }
            },
            "row_4": {
              "type": "_accordion-row-dynamic",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "What should I do if my shoes get wet?",
                "content": "<p>Take out the removable insoles, blot away surface water with a soft cloth and let everything dry naturally at room temperature. Keep them away from radiators, hairdryers and direct sun, as strong heat can damage the shoe.</p>",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              }
            },
            "row_5": {
              "type": "_accordion-row-dynamic",
              "settings": {
                "heading": "Can I take out and clean the insoles?",
                "content": "<p>Yes, the memory-foam insoles are removable. Air them out regularly and wipe them gently with a damp cloth, but do not soak or machine wash them.</p>",
                "open_by_default": false,
                "icon": "none",
                "width": 20
              }
            }
